#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:5 09c75d5d68314339bf548fd498805a4a
#: 4d8629179d31438bb0c4bf3fe92f79fa bb31f9118cde47169947336db2e010d3
#: c36f6a7b594249c38f6251e653116808 cf46dc9455c5481a841e30c42a5eb05f
#: d826950ee2544afebd347168808d954f
msgid "Spektrum RC Systems"
msgstr "Spektrum RC 系统"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:7 2aa1ce1e0fad4a8e95979d5dd1e72e55
#: 38a7a28d39eb4647b79bcd1d53c2f05d 396056a3513e48ed8b8e39e89e2128fc
#: 87c7af5cce374165b84a7bc6d7348d89 b84374bb0f6747cd9a29b6e4a16dc03e
#: eee58b809d7f4d4197054d7f0a450889
msgid ""
"Any DSM/DSM2 compatible receiver can be used with ArduPilot. Spektrum also "
"makes receivers with SBus, PPM, SRXL and SXRL2 protocols which are also "
"compatible."
msgstr ""
"任何 DSM/DSM2 兼容接收机均可与 ArduPilot 配合使用。Spektrum 也提供支持 SBus、PPM、SRXL 和 SRXL2 "
"协议的接收机，同样兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:9 02011d99dd644a8c9059c1d16e6f6fb6
#: 1623bba4ebbd4f938a919c0985920cde 1c6a8e17cb644aae9913e4de7eb1acd9
#: 247d17465b1e4e57bea853c6957173bc 3f945681cf25405cb074618e2adf77d2
#: 670c229b7a6b48638871b580a1891cc6
msgid ""
"For a **Spektrum DSM**, **DSM2**, or **DSM-X Satellite** receiver, connect "
"to the **SPKT/DSM** port (some boards, such as the CUBE mini carrier board, "
"require you to modify solder bridges. See the autopilot board's "
"documentation)"
msgstr ""
"对于 **Spektrum DSM**、**DSM2** 或 **DSM-X Satellite** 接收机，请连接至 **SPKT/DSM** "
"接口（某些板子如 CUBE mini 载板可能需要修改焊接桥，请参阅飞控板文档）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:16
#: 342abf2bd74444a9988990f14110d63a a77a6bb6fa164ef1adc4f6ecd6e56019
#: b66fcfd3770a43bd917ff253ab479a8b c4c6a800a11a4b699a7212f38e8b0e4e
#: dab61e0cddc1422cbe2d503694c140e0 ed7cd5b02bfc405abeea1339783141e7
msgid "Spektrum Satellite Receivers"
msgstr "Spektrum 卫星接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:18
#: 52b9e1320b664870847119b2d5750c93 5dd915bac61047fb9960c9540f92702f
#: 716e824664904b26a7d1c56ba862be44 8cd5d07669f645ad97db6fa338ca0cdf
#: c3c64b7b891148f8ac73df24607e3389 d15e9c31c94244dea36b280e9e9dc374
msgid ""
"`Spektrum Satellite Receivers "
"<http://www.spektrumrc.com/Products/Default.aspx?ProdID=SPM9645>`__ work as "
"a DSM receiver with Pixhawk. Spektrum satellite receivers do not have "
"buttons to bind, so there are two ways to bind them to a transmitter. They "
"are connected as if they were PPM-SUM or SBus output devices. ArduPilot "
"automatically discovers the serial protocol being used."
msgstr ""
"`Spektrum 卫星接收机 "
"<http://www.spektrumrc.com/Products/Default.aspx?ProdID=SPM9645>`__ 可作为 DSM "
"接收机与 Pixhawk 配合使用。Spektrum 卫星接收机没有对频按钮，因此有两种方式将其对频到发射机。它们像 PPM-SUM 或 SBus "
"输出设备一样连接，ArduPilot 会自动识别所用的串行协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:23
#: 2c07746085bd4580bf312e3e7a8d0f0b 39d2d39217aa45959ae9e85f5b9cd993
#: 408947499db34f97b2d47c280980c327 9c70266d3b99400193ab9cd753a90def
#: b27e08757c0c4e71bfbf7e3c278a45dc c5454b55a6df4ba7a6cd99593e8adcc3
msgid ""
"Pre-bind the Spektrum Satellite to your transmitter using a conventional "
"Spektrum receiver with satellite attached, then disconnect the satellite "
"from the conventional receiver, and connect it to the Spektrum port on "
"autopilot"
msgstr ""
"先使用常规 Spektrum 接收机（附带卫星接收机）将卫星接收机对频到发射机，然后从常规接收机上断开卫星接收机，将其连接到飞控的 Spektrum "
"接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:27
#: 0bbbe4d8a948427e9a1245997aa01863 1e51789ece004fc9be025d8c66945ebd
#: 6a82b75e00d64127bc4865a9fc4cd3fe 8c565421bc2642f1ad2c74f24b2ec321
#: a679b0b9acdc4c14977610e3852b0f24 cbc871044aea4bbd92852d96f788f75e
msgid ""
"Bind the satellite receiver using Mission Planner to initiate the bind. This"
" functionality is located in Radio Calibration screen on Initial Setup."
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 发起对频，在初始设置的遥控校准页面可找到此功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:34
#: 76b56731ff064e64bce8cbc994a640fc 78cf052b4e644e9d8fbaefdc11b80493
#: 93ab2ec154704fd986d6c62ea79842e2 9ebe2f0159df464bb2175c863c90cd2e
#: df96b1b0e7bf4e8aa934d92042349a68 fbcec381b1004b0bb1ef1153806e316e
msgid ""
"Being a satellite, range may be limited and the preceding receivers and "
"methods may provide greater range."
msgstr "作为卫星接收机，其通信距离可能有限，上述接收机及方法可能提供更远的通信距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:46
#: 0246c0e1f292416bbb843003cf5ef5ad 06cb911fea2344c383f77f42965951ff
#: 26a4ede23a1a406b8fbeb6879c06c5ee 73b85f7f241f4d79b45c0b9f595a4770
#: c8386aed1ee64e2fb9ccce7bae8ce2e5 cc00cc8cf64c4128b9d9bc086f5de857
msgid "Spektrum SRXL2 Receivers"
msgstr "Spektrum SRXL2 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:48
#: 2576cac675844a52a02ba938951f6ed8 4ac22281c108447b9f04a8aaae229675
#: 5374fc81f4c346ecbfc11ad3c75e9a16 87935621d6634d7e8ba96ca1d5d6a9f7
#: d0fb1c9275c34878b1dfe2ece9e15774 f7aaa22b41ca45399de13d93e3ab0acd
msgid ""
"All Spektrum receivers released since August 2019 only support the `SRXL2 "
"<https://github.com/SpektrumRC/SRXL2>`__ protocol. SRXL2 is a single-wire, "
"half-duplex protocol that supports integrated telemetry and a number of "
"other features."
msgstr ""
"2019年8月以后发布的所有 Spektrum 接收机均仅支持 `SRXL2 "
"<https://github.com/SpektrumRC/SRXL2>`__ 协议。SRXL2 "
"是一种单线半双工协议，支持集成数传数传及多种其他功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:50
#: 05ca831cdd8b4d579204c1ec21e653eb 666bd82a87d04142a76f2cb0f891184c
#: 77003e7016e648c9b7eb06b840397ef1 78af7d4af7bf4a229c431bf1c5692b99
#: 8b0cbb7ee41a4d04949843be5378bd4d fdb80e7bbd5c4e7ab80441246df310df
msgid ""
"An `SRXL2 cable "
"<https://www.spektrumrc.com/Products/Default.aspx?ProdID=SPM4650>`__ has "
"four wires, one of which is not connected. This new format is to distinguish"
" them from older receivers supporting DSMX since DSMX and SRXL2 are "
"incompatible."
msgstr ""
"`SRXL2 线缆 "
"<https://www.spektrumrc.com/Products/Default.aspx?ProdID=SPM4650>`__ "
"共四根线，其中一根未连接。此新格式用于区分支持 DSMX 的旧接收机，因为 DSMX 和 SRXL2 不兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:52
#: 4ef66d535625438da90d970419800695 86448e5acdd24d8e87fc973431343293
#: c3e3c3fe1f244cea95be5a654e522bfe c5f1631f22d741d9804156675100d136
#: db7ed960d6254cdf930fa2035189987e f6ed3fe451114570a5fba7f256a47853
msgid ""
"SRXL2 receivers must be connected to a UART. SRXL2 receivers support a wide "
"range of voltages, including the 5v available on a UART so connect GND to "
"GND, VCC  to VCC and the signal wire to the TX pin of the UART."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 接收机必须连接到 UART。SRXL2 接收机支持宽范围电压，包括 UART 上可用的 5V，因此将 GND 接 GND，VCC 接 "
"VCC，信号线接 UART 的 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:54
#: 0b2ce7e2955048e6ad4cba5c249e5a48 32bfa9384b9a4cfe8cc1b59e5c093cb5
#: 3e9e488f2efb427ea5b49bafc482ed52 8873c825758e489b8229810fe9e0fde0
#: d1ac87f85f774dbcb68e381199d76b57 f6d69507c069499dada13c22309f90c2
msgid ""
"In the configuration of the serial port select the RCIN protocol and set the"
" serial options to half-duplex operation. So for example for serial port 4:"
msgstr "在串口配置中选择 RCIN 协议，并将串口选项设置为半双工工作模式。例如，对于串口4："

