#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:60
#: 22f17875157943ab9104c515b067cb97 6277818f5cb346eab18fa001d4ab193c
#: 6ec1d61d46414abd8f8582bf9d13476a a8b5e4c7329b45e8af05856fc4b8333e
#: b8d4ce753293418b986d666ec444e042 e060a6cbe0694dcca8ea884e84ce1042
msgid ""
"Many single board autopilots support RC input on serial port 6 only exposing"
" the RX connection. For F7 autopilots, such as the Kakute F7, it is "
"necessary to swap the RX and TX pins in order to support SRXL2. It is also "
"necessary to support serial access on the UART by using the board's "
"alternate configuration:"
msgstr ""
"许多单板飞控仅在串口6上暴露 RX 连接支持 RC 输入。对于 F7 飞控（如 Kakute F7），需要交换 RX 和 TX 引脚才能支持 "
"SRXL2。同时还需要通过板子的备用配置启用 UART 的串行访问："

#: ../../source/docs/common-spektrum-rc.rst:62
#: 1f30c06c61e34e4180825a89b2fc6ddd 3a3dd608b00848d3887976fe3551e40c
